        "created_at": "2019-05-10T04:02:51.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Funny thing to me about the a Far from Home trailer was how OblivAeon was supposed to be tying up all the loose ends and multiverses - Avengers: Endgame sure seems like it's blown&nbsp;<em>open</em> all the crazy time travel and multiverse plots now!</p>",
