        "created_at": "2019-05-10T15:52:19.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I have to say, though, they pulled one over on me. &nbsp;I was expecting Nebula to just take the Gauntlet like in the comics. &nbsp;But now I’m just waiting for the Captain America: Time Cop spinoff. &nbsp;I do wonder if he got like a wish granted or something for giving up the Soul Stone.</p>",
