        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/p/b5ac83/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2025-10-30T11:46:59.678Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I really enjoyed Avengers: Endgame! It was such an emotional and satisfying conclusion to the whole Infinity Saga. I loved how it brought together so many characters and storylines from over ten years of Marvel movies. The mix of action, humor, and emotional moments felt just right.</p>\n<p>The final battle was incredible — seeing all the heroes unite gave me chills. Tony and Steve’s endings were really powerful and felt like the perfect way to wrap up their stories. Overall, Endgame wasn’t just a great superhero movie, it was an amazing experience for fans who followed the journey from the beginning.</p>",
